# Pairs with NoTrimPastLiveNeed. The leaf publishes the allocator's head rather
# than its durable checkpoint, so the floor passes writes it has not checkpointed.
MODULE: NoTrimPastLiveNeedPublishPastCheckpoint
TARGET: NoTrimPastLiveNeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the pin is published at the head rather than the checkpoint
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
    /\ MergeLeafPin(route, cp)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the head, not the checkpoint.
    /\ MergeLeafPin(route, next - 1)
--- END
